All department heads shall:
(1) Be immediately responsible to the county manager for the effective administration of their respective departments and all activities assigned thereto.
(2) Keep informed as to the latest practices in their particular field and initiate with the approval of the county manager, such new practices as appear to be of benefit to the county and to the public;
