(a) The finance director shall maintain a record of all accounts in which county funds are deposited.
(b) All deposit accounts shall, as a minimum, require the signature of two authorized persons for disbursement. Persons appointed to the following positions shall be authorized to sign checks, orders for withdrawal or other similar orders for disbursement:
(1) Chairperson of the board of commissioners;
(2) County manager;
(3) County clerk;
(4) Director of finance and purchasing; and
(5) Special projects director.
